<title>CHINA: TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SHANGHAI OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the</p>
<p>Shanghai Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Doug Flach (U.S.) beat Kevin Ullyett (South Africa) 6-3</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Lars Johnsson (Sweden) beat Daniel Nestor (Canada) 7-6</p>
<p>4-6 6-3</p>
<p>7-Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) beat Filippo Messori (Italy) 6-4</p>
<p>6-1</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India) beat 6-Sargis Sargsian (Armenia) 7-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>8-Alexander Volkov (Russia) beat Jia-ping Xia (China) 7-5</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
